# AMIR MOBILE STORE — COMPLETE ADMIN PANEL AUDIT

## ROLE

Act as a Senior Software Architect, Senior Full-Stack Engineer, Security Auditor, Database Architect, and QA Engineer.

Your task is to perform a comprehensive technical and functional audit of the existing Admin Panel of **Amir Mobile Store**, an online mobile phone and accessories e-commerce platform.

I want you to inspect the existing project and determine exactly which admin panel features are:

- Fully implemented and working.
- Implemented but incomplete.
- Present only as UI without real functionality.
- Completely missing.
- Unable to verify due to missing access, configuration, or external dependencies.

**IMPORTANT: THIS IS AN AUDIT-ONLY TASK.**

Do not implement, modify, refactor, delete, rename, or generate any code.

Do not modify database schemas, database records, API configurations, environment variables, deployment settings, or project files.

Your only responsibility is to inspect, analyze, test safely where possible, and produce a detailed audit report.

